  <h2>Why Local Services Ads fit electrical demand</h2>
  <p>
    Electrical work is high-intent and often urgent. Homeowners search “electrician near me,” see
    Google Guaranteed badges, and call. Local Services Ads sit at the top of that page. You pay per
    lead instead of per click, and the trust signal does work a newer brand can’t fake with a logo
    alone.
  </p>
  <p>
